@ekemma @DrZobo @SMILEWithmeNGO @AspenNewVoices @AspenInstitute @aspeninnovators @ekemma thank you for joining the fight against cervical cancer in Nigeria. 
Since your work involves policy and advocacy, I would love to know a few things:
1. Do we have a policy on the integration of HPV vaccination into the National immunization program?

@ekemma @DrZobo @SMILEWithmeNGO @AspenNewVoices @AspenInstitute @aspeninnovators What is the role of parents in preventing cervical cancer?

Can we create jingles to sensitize the public about the disease and other lifestyle-related cancer? 

Is there any possibilities of producing the HPV vaccine in Nigeria?
